1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:03,640
Yes, P'.

2
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:11,559
I'm back at P'Kan's place. I tried to clear things up,
but he doesn't even remember

3
00:00:11,559 --> 00:00:14,920
that it was me.

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:20,400
I really… don't want to stay here, P'.

5
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:56,920
Hold on a sec.

6
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:04,519
Hello? Earth? What's up?
I'm literally about to get to the climax here.

7
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,400
I'm with my girlfriend.

8
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,400
Alright, we'll talk later.

9
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:28,079
Earth.

10
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,399
Earth—wake up.

11
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:50,422
P'…
Where am I?

12
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:57,719
You're in my room.
Are you sick?

13
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:06,920
Shit— you're burning up.
